Z||000004||filthyscarecrow||04-01-2001||11:26 PM||||jongbloed is still around from what i know. we use jongbloeds on the formula car here at u of m, but he couldn't make them to spec so we had to make spacers on the wheels to make them fit. the guys who designed the uprights were REALLY pissed   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>the phone number we have at the shop is the same as above (505-538-5369) so my guess is bill is still around. good luck...<p>[This message has been edited by filthyscarecrow (edited 04-01-2001).]||||reg||1
